    "action": {
      "type": "SET_CONTENT",
      "input": {
        "content": "Highberg is the least-resolved of the Dutch firms in the lead set. Nothing about its stack, size or open-source posture was researched, so it ranks last on evidence rather than last on merit \u2014 the distinction being that no negative finding has been recorded against it.\n\nThe note exists to mark the gap. In a Dutch cohort where most names carry either a Common Ground connection, a stated open-source posture or a named client, an entry with none of the three is either a genuinely poor fit or simply unexamined, and the record as it stands cannot tell which. Priority 4, needs OSS screen.\n\n---\n\n## Leads sharing this finding (1)\n\n**4 \u00b7 needs OSS screen**\n- Highberg (NL)\n\nVerbatim research text this claim was extracted from:\n\n> Least-resolved NL firm.",
        "updatedAt": "2026-08-19T11:30:02.867078Z"
      },
      "timestampUtcMs": "2026-08-19T11:30:02.867082Z"
    }
